# Package manager: pnpm only

When installing dependencies, running scripts, or changing packages in this project, use **pnpm** — not npm, yarn, or bun.

| Task | Command |
|------|---------|
| Install | `pnpm install` |
| Dev / build / lint | `pnpm dev`, `pnpm build`, `pnpm lint`, etc. |
| Add dependency | `pnpm add <name>` or `pnpm add -D <name>` |
| Remove | `pnpm remove <name>` |

The canonical lockfile is `pnpm-lock.yaml`. Do not run `npm install`, `yarn`, or edit `package-lock.json`.
